{
    "word": "triskaidekaphobia",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4fdd52f4-1145-317c-9921-1012f70d5cf9",
                "word": "triskaidekaphobia",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "342809c2-f34f-39d7-8f79-c16e6e3f646f",
                        "entry_id": "4fdd52f4-1145-317c-9921-1012f70d5cf9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fear or dislike of the number thirteen (13)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea91e354-a964-4863-9281-68e3b4032653",
                                "sense_id": "342809c2-f34f-39d7-8f79-c16e6e3f646f",
                                "text": "Yet, despite beliefs that triskaidekaphobia began long ago and has been passed down through the centuries, the earliest known reference to Friday the 13th as a dreaded day did not appear until 1913. It is merely a 20th century invention."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbe1f896-c694-4ee4-a11f-1d4a0e73e726",
                                "sense_id": "342809c2-f34f-39d7-8f79-c16e6e3f646f",
                                "text": "The great Austrian-American composer Arnold Schoenberg had such a severe case of triskaidekaphobia (the fear of the number 13), he omitted numbering the 13th measure in some of his later works, substituting it with the notation “12a.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e147d2f8-1a63-4082-8211-97c5834074f6",
                                "sense_id": "342809c2-f34f-39d7-8f79-c16e6e3f646f",
                                "text": "There’s even a name to describe the irrational dread of the date: paraskevidekatriaphobia — a specialized form of triskaidekaphobia, a fear of the number 13."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6703aa18-8928-47db-be1a-503a63ed8e65",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fdd52f4-1145-317c-9921-1012f70d5cf9",
                        "source_sense_id": "342809c2-f34f-39d7-8f79-c16e6e3f646f",
                        "source_sense_description": "fear or dislike of the number 13",
                        "target_lang_word": "triskaidekafobie",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "triskaidekafobie",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b408e052-277a-34b1-80ab-104482a2d178",
                                        "entry_id": "e85af5f1-e79b-3013-948b-d05b75ee7490",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "angst voor het getal dertien"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "583f9d19-b2f7-4dab-adc7-e45800b0f5a7",
                                                "sense_id": "b408e052-277a-34b1-80ab-104482a2d178",
                                                "text": "Er is een keurig aanhangsel met citaten en cijfers en feiten, met natuurlijk een aparte ingang onder triskaidekafobie - de angst voor het getal 13 - omdat Apollo 13 immers, weergaloos toeval, om 13:13 uur plaatselijke tijd werd gelanceerd en op 13 april in nood kwam."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a353693-214d-458d-9957-bd86657a7329",
                                                "sense_id": "b408e052-277a-34b1-80ab-104482a2d178",
                                                "text": "Er bestaat een landelijk comité van dertien (!) personen ter bestrijding van dit bijgeloof dat bekend staat als \"triskaidekafobie\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
